// Disables independent AI.
// Add in here any necessary disable commamds.
//
// HZM coop [user 2026-08-22, bug-2033/2034] Retail is one line: enableEnemy = 0. We add a
// READABLE mirror of it, because enableEnemy itself is write-only - reading it throws
// "Cannot set a read-only variable", and a Script Error skips the statement rather than
// failing loudly, so a guard written against it silently does nothing.
//
// A map that calls this has DECLARED the actor to be scenery. officer.scr::
// coop_isProtectedActor reads coop_aiDisabled to keep the AI personality roll off him -
// that roll overwrites type_attack on ~65% of rolls and locks a prone pose on ~12%, which
// destroys the think the map assigned. One file covers every scripted actor on every map of
// the trilogy, present and future, with no per-map list to maintain or forget.
self.enableEnemy = 0
self.coop_aiDisabled = 1
